          "text": "Adult neural stem cells engineered to express the anti-inflammatory cytokine IL-10 exhibit enhanced immunosuppressive effects, promote remyelination, and support neuronal repair in experimental autoimmune encephalitis, a model for multiple sclerosis."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Adult neural stem cells expressing IL-10 confer potent immunomodulation and remyelination in experimental autoimmune encephalitis.",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "Adult neural stem cells engineered to express the anti-inflammatory cytokine IL-10 exhibit enhanced immunosuppressive effects, promote remyelination, and support neuronal repair in experimental autoimmune encephalitis, a model for multiple sclerosis."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Osthole augments therapeutic efficiency of neural stem cells-based therapy in experimental autoimmune encephalomyelitis.",
      "claims": [
        {
          "text": "Osthole pretreatment enhances the therapeutic efficacy of bone marrow-derived neural stem cell (BM-NSC) therapy in experimental autoimmune encephalomyelitis (EAE) by conferring potent anti-inflammatory capacity, improving the survival environment for transplanted cells, and protecting myelin sheaths from further demyelination."
